<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead">How Nexus Wave Technologies handles information across this website and its services.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose card">
    <h2>Information we receive</h2><p>We may receive information you provide directly, such as an email address when you contact us or create an account. Service providers such as Supabase may process authentication and account data on our behalf.</p>
    <h2>How we use information</h2><p>Information is used to provide requested features, maintain account security, respond to support requests, improve reliability, and meet legal obligations.</p>
    <h2>Website utilities</h2><p>Browser-only utilities may process text locally on your device. They do not require an account unless a page explicitly says otherwise.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>Some account features use browser storage for session information. You can clear browser storage through your device or browser settings.</p>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Some features may connect to third-party services for authentication, payments, AI, media processing, or other requested functionality. Their own privacy terms may also apply.</p>
    <h2>Women Safety Campaign and creative contributions</h2>
    <p>People may choose to participate in the Women Safety Campaign through approved volunteer roles, awareness activities, educational resources, poetry, short campaign messages, accessibility-friendly content or other responsible contributions. Campaign participation is reviewed through the Nexus team process.</p>
    <p>We do not require contributors to disclose a survivor's identity or private details. Evidence shared for review should be relevant, lawful to share and limited to what is necessary. Creative contributions such as poetry are treated as campaign content and may be reviewed before publication or recognition.</p>
    <h2>Data retention and deletion</h2><p>We retain information only as needed for the service, security, legal obligations, or legitimate operational needs. Contact us to request deletion where applicable.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: September 27, 2026.</p>
  </div></div></section>
</Layout>